catalog: Panel
target: path-ref panel
summary: The path-ref panel type

!! Commands

* ``path-ref:add`` — Path-ref explorer: add an element under the current node
* ``path-ref:list-refs`` — Path-ref explorer: list the metarecords pointing at the selected node (here / other / new)
* ``path-ref:set`` — Path-ref explorer: change a view setting
* ``path-ref:toggle-scope`` — Path-ref explorer: toggle the scope (the exact node ⇄ its whole subtree)

!! Generic commands

Provides ``parent``, ``root``, ``refresh``, ``index``, ``count``, ``select``, ``entries``, ``descend``, ``leaf`` to [[Generic panel commands]].
